WEBVTT

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:06.830
It possesses enormous power,
and brings endless pleasure

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:10.800
and destruction  to those who are destined.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.550
The Witchblade.

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.550
At this moment, one woman has awakened.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:33.460
Just before the shot, my chest feels like it's gonna tear open

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.050
I shout out countless times, break out

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:42.240
It's not over, rush through the endless night

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.530
Hot blood flows through my body

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:51.240
The moment it ultimately rots away

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:57.840
it's all over, fragments of an empty dream come to mind

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:03.340
I can never go back, I can't remember a thing

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.880
I've been reduced to struggling, and my voice won't carry

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:12.390
Uncontrollable impulses

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:19.310
Give me your XTC, let me feel it one more time

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:26.530
This body heats up, and I shout out your name in the darkness

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:33.530
Give me your XTC, I don't need false love

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.710
I will accept it, sin and punishment

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:43.280
Slash through the destiny I've been set up with, Blade

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:49.810
"Defiance"

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:52.230
Will she be okay?

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:52.320
"Defiance"

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:56.280
She may be equipped with the
Witchblade, but she's still a rookie.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.030
If something should happen...

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:01.660
I want to see the extent of her power.

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:05.870
Even if she dies, we can
retrieve the Witchblade.

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:09.620
Would you... prefer that?

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:13.960
Begin.

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:49.370
It's coming... Something strong...

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:51.170
Something strong...

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.880
...is coming!

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:12.190
I can't get enough... Down in my gut...
I have this unbearable urge!

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:22.150
Looks like it's about to begin.

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.080
I don't know what it is...

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:34.790
But I...

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:38.880
I must...

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:40.920
I want to...

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.930
...destroy it!

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:42.150
Wonderful!

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.870
I...

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:37.910
Yuck.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:42.880
It never ceases to gross me out...

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:46.380
But she really went on a rampage.

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:52.600
Though if she didn't lose
consciousness then, it would've been worse.

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:56.180
We should consider
ourselves lucky it ended like this

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:04.440
Let me out! Open up! Open up, I say!

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:06.400
Dammit!

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:08.490
Oww!

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:13.410
You heal quickly.

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:17.160
Is your toughness the reason
the Witchblade chose you?

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:19.920
How the hell should I know?!

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:28.760
What's going on?! Why do I have to fight?!
What is this Witchblade?!

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:32.220
I already told you, it exists solely to fight.

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:36.010
That doesn't tell me
anything! Explain it fully!

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:39.140
There's no need for explanations.

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:44.860
You should know full well by now
that you are a living weapon.

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:45.730
Weapon?

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:47.690
Don't be ridiculous! I'm !

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:52.860
You must have felt it. A craving for power.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:57.540
You fought without our urging. Isn't that so?

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:02.000
Y-You're wrong! I didn't fight...

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:05.880
The Witchblade has an
enormous influence on its wearer.

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:09.880
But we have the technology to support it.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:13.970
I will guarantee that you
can live with your daughter.

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:16.890
Has Riko... Has my daughter been found?!

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:20.230
Don't worry. I'll have her
brought to you immediately.

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:27.270
Think hard on this... Can you
exist burdened by such a thing?

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:28.900
I must hand it to you.

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:33.780
We went through pains to find her.
I can't let her just walk away.

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:35.410
What of her daughter?

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:37.620
No word yet.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:42.250
Put a rush on this. We need
her in order to use the woman.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:44.620
What do I do?

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:48.340
What Can I do?

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:53.930
Tell me, Riko...

00:07:57.390 --> 00:08:01.310
If you get lost, let's meet
under the Tokyo Tower!

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:14.860
Mom will definitely come! I have to go get her!

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:24.790
Someone... I must find someone...

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:30.880
And I'll warm her up real good... Zap!

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:35.590
Oops! That was close!

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:40.810
There you go. Be careful, now.
This area is dangerous, you know.

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:42.770
Thank you!

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:46.060
Why do I hafta go look for her?

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:50.820
You brought her! It's your responsibility!

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:55.150
She ran away from you, Mariko-san!
So you go find her!

00:08:55.240 --> 00:09:00.620
Quiet! If you won't go, then
pay up everything you owe me!

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:03.910
D-Damn! That's not fair!

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:13.960
That idiot!

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:38.860
Naomi, see where that child is.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:43.370
It's not NaOmi, it's Naomi!
No accent on the "o"!

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:47.370
Mariko-san, you never remember!
You're so mean!

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:49.870
Fine. Sorry.

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:54.340
No accent on the "o."
The "o" is important...

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:57.880
Where could she have gone?! Cripes!

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:09.440
One child!
Right, one child.

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:16.690
Huh?!
Oh no, a pickpocket got you...

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:19.780
Backpacks aren't good.
They're such easy targets.

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:23.780
What do I do? I want to
go to the Tokyo Tower...

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:27.000
Without a ticket...

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:29.160
Oh...

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:33.630
Doggy!

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:36.050
Hey, it's the little girl!

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:37.880
Mr. Boat Captain!

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:41.680
Been doing well, missy?
Yes!

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:51.140
That's all?!

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:54.900
Hey, I'll warm you up...

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:56.820
What is that?

00:10:56.900 --> 00:11:01.950
I'll warm you up real nice... Zap!

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.960
Zap!

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:32.890
I'm telling you, it's no problem!
The fare to Tokyo Tower isn't much!

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:36.940
No, my mom and I decided
when we came to Tokyo

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:41.820
that we wouldn't let people
pamper us just because we're girls.

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:43.780
You're so mature, Rihoko-Chan!

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:45.990
Thank you!

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:50.750
Say, after you left, Child Welfare
came by looking for you.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:57.790
Yeah... we met them.
But it was nothing at all.

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:00.880
Oh.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.930
What do you mean, the girl is gone?!

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:11.890
I can't help it if she ran away.

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:16.020
That's irresponsible! Adults are
to protect children, no matter what,

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:19.440
until they are in the custody
of the proper authorities!

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:23.030
It's part of the Child Welfare law!

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:26.870
You're such a pain!
Why don't you look for her?

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:32.040
Listen, you! Do you realize how
precious children are at this age?!

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:36.210
Hey, what are you doing?!
I'm not finished talking to you!

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:38.210
You're interfering with business!

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:41.800
Now get! Shoo! Shoo!

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.470
How rude!

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:54.930
Find her? I don't even know where to look.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:58.020
The Department of Child Welfare, huh?

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:01.690
Wonder if I can sneak in somehow...

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:06.740
All units, Minato Ward 4-1 0.
Behind Tagai Building. Code 09!

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:09.820
09?! That's a murder!

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:25.420
Let's see here...

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:30.720
What do you think?

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:33.470
We won't know specifics until the autopsy,

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:36.020
but it's as if her innards were
burned with extremely high heat.

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:37.230
Innards?!

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:42.610
To put it simply, her insides were microwaved.

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:46.240
Microwaved, huh? Interesting...

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:51.570
Again?

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:55.290
Yes. I believe it was an X-Con.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.910
This is becoming too frequent.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:01.420
Is it because the Witchblade has appeared?

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:06.170
We don't have enough
information to conclude that,

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:08.880
or whether the Douji Group
is connected to this.

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:12.140
Then find out.

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:19.770
Just what sort of person
has donned the Witchblade?

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:38.710
So we know her daughter was taken to that bar?

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:41.670
It seems she ran away from there, too.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:48.590
She's gutsy for a six-year-old.
Maybe it's inherited?

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:55.260
Yes, what is it?

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:57.640
What? An X-Con?

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:02.560
Yes, there's no mistake about it. An EM type.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:06.320
All right. Contact me again later.

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.230
Sir...

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:10.400
Yes. Time is running out.

00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:14.820
Have you thought it over?

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:22.870
You said you would guarantee
I could live with my daughter.

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.960
Can I believe you?

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.460
Of course.

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:30.840
All right...

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:34.930
Let's talk.

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:41.640
Mister! Doggy! Thank you!

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:43.390
Hold on, missy!

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:49.530
Here. I bought a flag,
so give this back to your mom.

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:56.820
The machine you fought here was
an "I-Weapon," our main product.

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:58.370
Product?

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:04.790
There is also an "X-Con" series, which
was pulled off the line due to system issues.

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:10.380
Several of these got loose during
the Great Quake and went missing.

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:11.800
Bye-bye!
Take care!

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:17.010
X-Cons are usually very hard
to distinguish from regular people,

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:19.890
so recovering them has been slow-going,

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:22.640
but when they came here,
they began to run amok.

00:16:27.190 --> 00:16:31.190
So far, there have been eleven victims.
You know what they can do.

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:34.990
At the detention center?!

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:40.120
You've already done it...
You can destroy the X-Cons.

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:43.410
We want you to lend us your power.

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:51.050
And if I do, I can live with my daughter?

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:52.670
I will guarantee it.

00:16:56.840 --> 00:17:03.430
Mom!

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:07.520
Do you have an answer?

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:14.690
Will you accept? Or not?

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:21.990
Which will it be?

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:25.910
Decide now.

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:40.890
Not enough... It just wasn't enough...

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:47.390
I want to heat something up... Zap!

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:49.600
Oh, stop it!

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:51.480
See you!
Bye!

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:58.400
Oh, the smell...
It's just a whiff, but that woman...

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:05.200
I must warm her up... Zap! Zap!

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:15.800
Warm her up... I'll warm her up!

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:23.970
I can sense it... the power!

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:28.730
This throbbing... I can't stop it!

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:41.530
Y-You're incredible!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:19:00.010
I'll warm you up! Real warm! Zap!

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:04.010
Zap! Zap!

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:10.020
You're good! Too good!

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:12.400
I'm not feeling anything...

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:35.130
X-Con has been recovered.

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:39.130
Good work. Take care of the rest quietly.

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:45.390
Whew, I certainly didn't
think you'd work out this nicely.

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:47.720
Say, have you found my daughter?!

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:49.770
Still no luck...

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:56.400
Let's try going to the bar where
Rihoko-Chan stayed the night.

00:19:57.730 --> 00:19:59.320
Hey! Stop!

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:46.660
Riko!

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.070
Mom...

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:50.700
Mom!

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:52.700
Riko!

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:55.670
Masane-san! Wait until we set down!

00:20:58.630 --> 00:21:01.300
Mom!
Riko!

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:05.470
Mom! I knew you'd come for me!

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:08.470
I promised, didn't I?!

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:12.390
Riko! Riko!
Mom! Mom!

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:23.940
It's been a long time.

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:28.030
Now why would you be calling me?

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:33.950
The Witchblade...
It seems a wearer has appeared.

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:39.920
I want to warm up... Zap!

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:07.280
I murmur, "I love you," with all my emotion

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:16.620
All my feelings until yesterday now overflow and dissolve quickly

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:28.550
If only this one last prayer could make it through...

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:37.390
Thank you for giving us the words to ascertain each other, God

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:49.400
Tomorrow, we'll reach out and hold hands harder than normal

00:22:49.490 --> 00:23:02.420
Tomorrow, we'll reach out, hug, kiss, and love each other

00:23:13.800 --> 00:23:17.770
Finally, our life in Tokyo will begin!

00:23:17.850 --> 00:23:20.100
But this hotel with heavy surveillance

00:23:20.190 --> 00:23:23.440
doesn't feel much like a home.

00:23:23.520 --> 00:23:26.320
We need to find a place

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:27.820
we can call our very own!

00:23:27.900 --> 00:23:30.690
Shall we try that building you mentioned?

00:23:30.780 --> 00:23:34.870
But I'm not sure... the landlord seems scary...
